{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "birth_bdl2_013hib_009_jp.gtx", "item_key": "birth_bdl2_013hib_009_1003_p", "source_sha256": "ee12320b06ae4e57cc2344bef20a57a1574cdb6256f8e84637bc593f13dafdcc", "ja": "そういえば朝はいたけど……\nリュックには入っていないのか？", "zh": "说起来，早上的时候还在的……\n难道没放进背包里吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
